  m_text: '<b>WHY PREPARE?</b>

    Secure or put away loose outdoor items before severe weather.


    This exercise uses small movable props and designated storage bays. It does not model wind, lifting ability or building safety.


    Prepare ahead of dangerous conditions; do not go out into severe weather to retrieve objects.


    Guidance: NSW Government / NSW SES

